Topic context     		A short overview of the Topic’s purpose and its end objectives
Purpose	To explain the determinants of India’s Foreign Policy to learners
objectives	1.	To make the students understand the basics of India’s Foreign Policy.
2.	To prepare the students for the UPSC’s Civil Services Examination.
Learning descriptions	An insight into the learners and learning environments
Pre-requisite	Foundations of Political Science and International Relations.
Learning environment	Physical Classroom/On-line LMS
Design specifications	
Performance goals	To train the learners to take projects/internships in Ministry For External Affairs and to promote the learners for employment in Civil Services Examination.
Learning outcomes	The Learner will be able 
1. to demonstrate the ground level problems and issues faced by the nation at the international level.
 2. to apply the knowledge gained while preparing to solve the questions based on the Optional Paper of PSIR in the Civil Services Examination conducted by the UPSC and MPSC.
